@ 1:2  g|antt
  1:1-1:6 "gantt"
  | **`gantt`**
  |
  | A gantt chart is `gantt`, then statements.
@ 2:7  date|Format YYYY-MM-DD
  2:3-2:13 "dateFormat"
  | **`dateFormat`**
  |
  | `dateFormat <format>`: how the task dates are written, e.g. `YYYY-MM-DD`.
@ 3:18  dateFormat YYYY|-MM-DD
  none
@ 4:5  ex|cludes weekends
  4:3-4:11 "excludes"
  | **`excludes`**
  |
  | `excludes <days>`: days a task skips, e.g. `weekends`, `friday`, `2024-01-01`.
@ 5:14  weekday mon|day
  5:3-5:17 "weekday monday"
  | **`weekday monday`**
  |
  | `weekday <day>`: the day week ticks start on.
@ 6:5  ti|tle Plan
  6:3-6:8 "title"
  | **`title`**
  |
  | `title <text>`: the chart title.
@ 7:6  sec|tion A
  7:3-7:10 "section"
  | **`section`**
  |
  | `section <name>`: starts a section; the tasks after it are drawn in it.
@ 8:6  acc|Title: Plan
  8:3-8:12 "accTitle:"
  | **`accTitle:`**
  |
  | `accTitle: <text>`: the accessible title.
@ 9:5  cl|ick a1 href "https://example.com" call show()
  9:3-9:8 "click"
  | **`click`**
  |
  | `click <ids> href "<url>"` and/or `call <function>(<args>)`, either first.
@ 9:13  click a1 h|ref "https://example.com" call show()
  9:12-9:16 "href"
  | **`href`**
  |
  | `href "<url>"`: the link a click opens, after `click <ids>`.
@ 9:41  click a1 href "https://example.com" ca|ll show()
  9:39-9:43 "call"
  | **`call`**
  |
  | `call <function>(<args>)`: the function a click calls, after `click <ids>`.
